msgid "Orchestration of the initialization tasks"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The deployment resource should not start until the job has been completed. "
"The typical pattern that is used among Kubernetes users is the\n"
"use of init containers to achieve this. An init container that `waits for` "
"the job to complete is enough to enforce that requirement."
msgstr ""

